Kanban 0.1, a new engine plugin:

* Nodes become cards in columns and swimlanes, decided by fields of their tiddlers (`status` by default, swimlanes by a field of your choice).
* Dragging a card to another cell rewrites those fields; the order of the cards is kept with the board.
* Columns and swimlanes are graph properties and can be added, renamed, moved and removed right on the board.
* Edges are drawn as arrows between the cards.
